  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIV - Promoting integrated resource management in the Kongou Zamay lake - Arondssment Comunal Niamey III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project helps to improve living conditions for local communities through the ecological restoration of the pond&#x2019;s banks. In doing so, the project improves of the water supply for various purposes, including the development of fisheries, while reducing the risks of flooding. It increases yields of various crops.En fran&#xe7;aisLa promotion de la gestion integr&#xe9;es des ressources de la mare de Kongou Zamay - Arrondissement Communal Niamey IIICe projet contribue &#xe0; l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration des conditions de vie des populations par le traitement biologique des berges de la mare; l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration de l&apos;appovisionnement en eau pour divers usages; le d&#xe9;veloppement de la p&#xea;che; l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration des rendements des diff&#xe9;rentes productions et la r&#xe9;ducation du ph&#xe9;nom&#xe8;ne d&apos;inondation.</narrative>
  </description>
